    <GraphId>415930263cef4bf8955112282f81e451</GraphId>
    <Name>Low latency 60 Hz detail booster &amp; limiter</Name>
    <Description>For drivers who prefer the classic 60 Hz FFB signal - with prediction to reduce latency.</Description>
