    <Modules>
      <FFBModuleData>
        <ModuleId>SourceLFE</ModuleId>
        <ModuleType>SourceLFE</ModuleType>
        <Description>The simulator's low-frequency effects audio, turned into wheel force.  You need to enable bass shaker LFE in iRacing and use VB-CABLE for this to work.</Description>
