      <FFBModuleData>
        <ModuleId>1fc4f2bc20c84f239be3a015ee55b173</ModuleId>
        <ModuleType>CrashProtection</ModuleType>
        <Description>Fades the force way down when a crash is detected, then ramps back smoothly - so a big impact cannot yank the wheel out of your hands.  Force reduction sets how much of the force is removed.</Description>
